    {
      "ja": "昔々、天皇の息子である「ヤマトタケル」というとても強い若い王子がいました。ある日、天皇は彼に、国で悪いことをしている悪者や反乱軍を倒すように命令しました。ヤマトタケルは喜んで出発し、知恵と強い力を使って、次々と敵を倒していきました。",
      "en": "Long, long ago, there was a very strong young prince named \"Yamato Takeru\" who was the Emperor's son. One day, the Emperor ordered him to defeat the bad guys and rebel forces doing evil things in the country. Yamato Takeru gladly set out, and using his wisdom and great strength, defeated the enemies one after another.",
